    "At actual12.5fps/.08-second pose timing, the sequence reads as a strong bounding run: compressed loads lead into genuine airborne poses, and extended-leg AIR5 descends into the new bent-knee contact0 with visible weight absorption. The23.41-world registration descent is exposed and supported by the actual changing leg pose rather than a root-only displacement.",
